---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Workflow Automation | Ecosoft"
  description="Eliminate manual steps with open-source workflow automation — document routing, approval chains, system integrations, and scheduled jobs built into your ERP."
>


  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Workflow Automation</p>
      <h1>Stop doing manually what your system should handle automatically.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Most ERP implementations stop at data entry. The biggest gains come after — when the system starts
        routing documents, triggering approvals, notifying the right people, and connecting to external services
        without anyone manually pushing buttons.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Tell Us What You're Automating</a>
        <a href="/book-demo" class="btn btn-outline">See a Live Automation Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE AUTOMATE -->
  <section class="section" style="background: var(--surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="text-align:center;">What Ecosoft automates</h2>
      <p class="section-lead" style="text-align:center;">Common automation patterns we've implemented across manufacturing, trading, and government clients.</p>
      <div class="cards-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:2.5rem;">

        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">📋</div>
          <h4>Approval workflows</h4>
          <p>Purchase orders, expense claims, leave requests, and contract approvals routed automatically to the right approver based on value, department, and policy rules — with email notifications and deadline escalation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">📄</div>
          <h4>Document generation</h4>
          <p>Quotations, purchase orders, invoices, delivery notes, and reports generated automatically from ERP data — formatted to your branding and sent to customers or suppliers without manual intervention.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">🔁</div>
          <h4>System integrations</h4>
          <p>Bidirectional data sync between your ERP and external systems — e-commerce platforms, logistics APIs, banking feeds, government portals, and custom line-of-business applications.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">⏱️</div>
          <h4>Scheduled jobs</h4>
          <p>Recurring inventory reconciliation, automated reorder triggers, scheduled financial close jobs, and periodic report generation — all running on schedule without manual initiation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">🔔</div>
          <h4>Alerts & notifications</h4>
          <p>Stock level alerts, overdue invoice notifications, production milestone updates, and compliance deadline reminders — delivered via email, LINE, or internal ERP notification.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">🔄</div>
          <h4>Data transformation</h4>
          <p>Automated data cleaning, format conversion, and aggregation pipelines — turning raw ERP data into the structures your reporting, export, or integration layer needs.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW WE BUILD -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width:760px; margin:0 auto;">
        <h2>How we build automation</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          We use the native automation capabilities of Odoo and ERPNext where possible — these are maintained, tested,
          and upgrade-safe. For requirements beyond what the platform provides natively, we build custom modules to OCA standards.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1.5rem; margin-top:2rem;">
          <div class="info-card">
            <h4>Odoo Automated Actions</h4>
            <p>Odoo's built-in automation engine handles time-based and event-based triggers, field updates, email sending, and record creation — all configurable without code for common patterns.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <h4>ERPNext Server Scripts & Webhooks</h4>
            <p>ERPNext's server script layer enables custom automation logic in Python, plus webhook delivery to external systems on document events — create, submit, cancel, amend.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <h4>Custom OCA-standard modules</h4>
            <p>For complex automation requirements that exceed native capabilities, Ecosoft develops custom modules to OCA coding standards — maintainable, upgrade-safe, and documented.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <h4>n8n / Python integration bridges</h4>
            <p>For multi-system orchestration, Ecosoft can deploy n8n (open-source automation) or custom Python services to bridge your ERP with external platforms and APIs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-strip">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What's the most painful manual process in your business today?</h2>
      <p>Tell us and we'll show you how to automate it. Most common patterns can be implemented in days, not months.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Let's Talk Automation</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
